Summary:
- **Component:** esphome `tmp102` (I²C, addr 0x48 default) — docs + source copied to `outputs/`
- **Datasheet:** TI SBOS397B, downloaded via `analog.sh` → web.archive, converted with pymupdf4llm
- **Spec highlights:** full register map (Temperature/Configuration/TLOW/THIGH), pointer addressing, 4 ADD0 addresses, ALERT/Open-drain semantics, 12/13-bit two's-complement conversion with worked test vectors from Tables 5 & 6
- **Feedback:** `feedback/tmp102/prompt0a.md` (datasheet URL was only in esphome source, not the docs page; extended-mode hex encoding resolved in the Encoding column)
